  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UPSC NDA II Recruitment 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-11T10:12:16+05:30\">June 11, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:12 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/whats-new\">Union Public Service Commission UPSC</a>,</strong> has released <strong>a Notification</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong>&nbsp;for the Recruitment of&nbsp;<strong>Examination of National Defence Academy &amp; Naval Academy II 2026.</strong> The&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\">UPSC application form</strong>&nbsp;has started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"410\">20 May 2026</strong>, and candidates can apply until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"458\">11 June 2026</strong>. candidates must be born not earlier than 01 January 2008 and not later than 01 January 2011. Candidates must check the complete details for <strong>UPSC NDA II&nbsp;Recruitment 2026</strong> Provided below. <strong>(Advt. No. 10/2026-NDA-II)</strong></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UPSC NDA II Online Form 2026 – Last Date Today</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UPSC National Defence Academy &amp; Naval Academy II Examination 2026 : Short Details </h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsc-nda-2-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>20 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>11 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>11 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong><strong> 13 September 2026</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date :<strong> Will Be Update Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>UPSC</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>General, OBC </strong>: <strong>₹ 100/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SC / ST / All Female</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 0/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UPSC National Defence Academy &amp; Naval Academy II Notification 2026 : Age Limit As On UPSC Rules.</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The candidate’s <strong>date of birth must be between 01 January 2008 and 1 January 2011</strong> (both dates inclusive).</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per <strong>UPSC</strong><strong> Examination 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">394 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UPSC National Defence Academy &amp; Naval Academy II Recruitment 2026 :&nbsp;Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Army</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"120\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">208</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Navy</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"120\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">42</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Airforce</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">120</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Naval Academy</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">24</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp; UPSC NDA II Recruitment 2026 : </span>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For Army Wing</strong>: Must have passed or be appearing in 10+2 (any stream) from a recognized board in India.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For Air Force &amp; Naval Wing</strong>: Must have passed or be appearing in 10+2 with <strong>Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics</strong>&nbsp;as subjects.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For more details read the official notification before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Fill UPSC NDA II Online Form 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interested candidates who wish to apply for the&nbsp;<b>UPSC </b>post can submit their application online before&nbsp;<strong>11 June 2026.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Use the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Alternatively, visit the&nbsp;<strong>official website of UPSC </strong>to complete the application process online.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Make sure to complete the application before the deadline&nbsp;<a href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>11 June 2026.</strong></span></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 14pt;\">Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले&nbsp;<strong>Official Notification</strong>&nbsp;को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे । (<strong>Last Date, Age Limit, &amp; Education Qualification</strong>)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;UPSC NDA II Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Written Test</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSB Interview</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Apply Online Link</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noope